      "skillOrderNotes": {
        "interleave": "Two-source rules (docs/research/2026-10-gladiator-guide.md §3.2: daevaguides, mmo-codex): Rending Blow is the first point sink; Overhead Slam and Keen Strike follow as each allows; Ruinous Blow is raised as fast as its gate allows from Lv 14; Experienced Counterstrike (21) and Murderous Burst (25) go to 10 the level they are learned (flat gate, so they are listed after the core five, where the flat gate applies). The order between those rules is inferred.",
        "budget": "Core five to Lv 10 = 5 × 21 = 105 points; Experienced Counterstrike and Murderous Burst to 10 = 42 (147); Crushing Wave, Rush Strike and Leaping Slam to 8 = 13 each (186). LEVEL_POINTS[45] = 203 (Metabot; aion2turkiye agrees) plus Wisdom Stones."
      },
